   "firstViewTextSample": "Add to your Slack\nMeet Atlas,\nyour AI coworker.\n\nAtlas works alongside your team in Slack to answer questions, automate tasks, and help everyone do their best work.\n\nPrep for a call\nDebug a regression\nOnboard a new hire\nCatch up after time off\nPrep for a call\nDebug a regression\nOnboard a new hire\nCatch up after time off\nAdd to your Slack\nFoo Corp\nThreads\nHuddles\n\nChannels\n\ncustomer-success\nproduct-eng\ngeneral\nmarketing\ngtm-ops\nfinance\nleadership\n\nDirect messages\n\nAtlas\ncustomer-success\n9\nMessage #customer-success\nHow teams use Atlas\nRight where your team works\n\nAtlas lives in Slack — ready in any DM, channel, or thread the moment you need it.\n\nTalk it through\n\nAsk a question, add context, and dig deeper. Atlas keeps up as the conversation unfolds.\n\nTurn questions into action\n\nHave Atlas draft a brief, handle the follow-up, or set recurring work to run on its own.\n\nConnected to all your tools.\n\nAtlas connects to 300+ tools out of the box, plus anything with an API. It works across all of them at once, so a question that spans several systems comes back as one answer.\n\nA coworker for the whole team.\n\nMost AI lives in a private chat only you can see. Atlas works out in the open, in the shared channels your team already uses. Anyone can jump into a thread, add what they know, or pick up where a teammate left off.\n\nproject-orbit\nAtlas\nAGENT\n9:00 AM\n\nMorning standup — rate-limit fix merged overnight, beta docs in review, launch still on for Thursday.\n\nPriya\n9:03 AM\n\nDocs just went ",
